{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2024-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1704672000, "end_date": 1705363199, "month_true_total": 369, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:52:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "156066018", "author": {"steamid": "76561198271914164", "personaname": "Frost", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/frostbittenwinds/", "num_games_owned": 128, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 3725, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2531, "last_played": 1706616093, "avatar": "ccf802358039faf89a9707b85c5fe7c2f85062dc"}, "language": "english", "review": "game is addictive like other roguelikes but has a dynamic enough gameplay loop to keep it interesting.\n\nit can be immensely frustrating at points and you WILL find enemies you hate more than anything else, but the game makes it feel satisfying to make it all the way through despite the odds.\n\nsome heroes are definitely weaker than others but with the right build and weapons and some luck absolutely anything can work. I had a near perfect game on Tao and then immediately after died 13 times in MP and did 17x less damage than my teammate. just how it goes\n\n100% worth the price", "timestamp_created": 1705361803, "timestamp_updated": 1705361803, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "156055636", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353403953", "personaname": "FemNuts", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kocobutt/", "num_games_owned": 230, "num_reviews": 67, "playtime_forever": 1483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 811, "last_played": 1738039719, "avatar": "cd63b